People with your birthday are going to be super-duper lucky!
You might even run into a Legendary Pokémon! Or maybe not!
So anyway, see you later!
Congratulations, Champion. Here, I’ve got a little something for you as celebration.
Professor Magnolia! Why, you didn’t have to come all this way!
After everything
has achieved, it’s really the least I could do.
The Wishing Stars that make Dynamaxing possible are parts of Eternatus. And when Eternatus was awakened, Dynamax energy flooded the entire region...
Because of that, Dynamax Pokémon were popping up all over, causing trouble across all of Galar. But
and h
iser friends came to our rescue.
The Dynamax phenomenon has long been an important part of Galarian culture. I hope everyone will use the power of Dynamaxing correctly in the days to come.
So, young
. Please, do what you believe is best.
Poor Professor Magnolia... It seems she’s quite bothered by the chairman’s actions, since she helped carry out so much of the researching into Dynamaxing for him.
The Pokémon band, the Maximizers, is amazing live! Want to watch?
I do!
They can actually get pretty into it, so the performance might run pretty long! You still want to watch their concert?
I definitely do!
I think I’ll pass
They’re the max of the max, right? The Maximizers are wicked!
