Right, then. In that case...how about this? Let’s see if the two of you can show me such a brilliant battle that I’m left with no choice but to endorse you. And don’t worry. I’ll make sure both your teams are in good shape before the battle starts.
Right! I’ll be waiting outside,
Now remember, be sure to give it everything you’ve got. That’s the best thing you can do for your Pokémon—and for yourself, too.
I’m going to become the greatest Pokémon Trainer there is! And to do that, I need that endorsement to take part in the Gym Challenge!
Come at me with everything you have so we can prove to Lee that we’ve got what it takes!
I’m rather interested in seeing how you two young Trainers battle, too.
Listen, you two. The reason I’m unbeatable is because I learn from every battle I see or take part in. That’s how I’ve gotten to where I am today. So show me something good in this battle!
We’ll be sure to. Ready for this,
? Time for a serious match between you and me... to fill in another page in the tale of my legend!
I need to prepare...
It’s time for my legend to begin!
