But Lee really is the greatest Trainer! And I don’t want people to be laughing at him all because his little brother is rubbish!
It’s not enough! I’ve got to try harder! And harder and harder till no one’s laughing! I’m off, mate! Off to find the kind of Pokémon that I can really draw the strength out of!
You!
And you!
You’re not bad.
But not good, either. And I think I know why. You need more pink. Here, have a look at this League Card. Maybe it’ll inspire you to add a little more pink.
I plan on putting you both to the test soon, so you better not slack off on your training!
That child...
Gym Challengers should battle for the sake of their own Pokémon. Why worry about saving the Champion’s name? We all know he’s unbeatable.
Anyway, here’s something for letting me watch your battle.
Now, on you go, child. You’re headed to the Stow-on-Side Gym next, no? The Gym Challenge is about having fun.
You’re a Gym Challenger, right? Are you going to apply to challenge this Gym?
Maybe later
Hm! Then head to the changing room and change into your uniform. Then go to the Gym mission room.
