Bet there’ll be Ice-type Pokémon crawling out of the woodwork in a place like this!
! Reckon we’ll be able to train ourselves up to new heights here, before the Champion Cup starts?
I believe in myself and the Pokémon on my team, and I know we’ll all get loads stronger!
So I’m off! See you in Wyndon, mate!
All right! Wyndon City! This is the place where I become a legend at last!
You get it, don’t you, mate? After all, I’m about to become the new Champion of the Galar region!
That’s it! I’m headed straight for Wyndon Stadium!
Don’t waste too much time,
. You should head there yourself!
This is the reception desk!
Turns out I was the first to register for the Champion Cup. In other words, I’m already number one. It’s pretty much in the bag that I’ll win this thing!
, correct? We’ve been watching over your performance in the Gym Challenge. This is just a formality, of course, but I’ll need to check your Gym Badges, if you don’t mind.
I’m all sorted and ready to battle you on the biggest stage of them all!
