Let’s blot them out with our color, Hatterene! Time to Gigantamax!
I ain’t goin’ down that easy! I got skin in this game too, y’know!
I’m real proud of how well I’ve honed this move! Get ready to get sent packin’!
All right, Grimmsnarl! Make my wishes come true...and Gigantamax!
Time to dig my heels in for my friends! Just need to grow until we can reach victory!
My moves are grown with care in my garden! Don’t let yourselves get knocked flat!
Grow big and strong—Gigantamax! Time to harvest victory!
Even my last drop is enough to submerge you!
How long do you think you can stay dry up against our tidal might?
Get ready to be marooned in the widest of seas! Drednaw—time to Gigantamax!
Come on, Kabu—you can still win! Burn a path through to victory!
The only place I’m going is to the top! I’ll blaze my way through each battle!
Let your flames scorch all of Galar! I believe in you, Centiskorch!
I’ve got one last number for ya! Get ready to etch it into your ears and hearts!
Watch me strum out one wicked move! Get ready—I’m turnin’ it up to eleven!
All right, Raihan! Time to win this and become the true Galarian star you were born to be!
Ring out, dragon’s roar! Let them feel it in their bones!
Stand tall, Duraludon! Smash their hopes of winning to pieces!
You’d better concentrate! If you make the smallest slip, I’ll pounce on it!
Put your hips into it when you punch! Then take that fist and seize us our victory!
Time to go on the offensive! We’ll change the course of this battle with one hit!
All it takes is one pitfall to defeat you. How shall I start digging...?
Rise up, G-Max Volcalith! Can you escape from the prison of stone?
You’re unbreakable, Coalossal! I’ve got absolute faith in you!
Good-byes are so sad... P-please...stay with me...
I want to keep my whole team together... I’ll never...let any of them go!
C-creep out of the shadows, Gengar. Show them all your reproach...
The final freeze is the deepest! Get ready to shiver down to your bones!
Now watch how your partner Melony uses her ice, and feel the chill creep in!
Looks like an ice age is looming... How many minutes do you think you’ll last?
! How do you like this? I’ve...I’ve nothing left!
Now, let loose a move so dignified it defies description!
Only a true celebrity could retain this great poise in this great peril!
Feel free to gaze in wonderment at this move— as noble as it is damaging!
You’ve got us up against the wall, mate, but you’re about to see what we’re really made of!
See if you can keep up with this beat! Rillaboom, use G-Max Drum Solo!
I’ve got some massive dreams, and the only thing big enough to hold ’em is Gigantamaxing!
Burn ’em up, Cinderace! Show us a G-Max Fireball!
Wash ’em all away, Inteleon! Use G-Max Hydrosnipe!
Well now, that move certainly woke me up. It’d be rude not to return the favor!
There’s more to strength than just physical power. Now, let’s sap some of that vitality!
Keeping things simple is just boring. Have a taste of this refined flavor!
Master! I’ll never give up on the dojo! My psychic power will end things here and now!
Fuhaha! Now that’s what I like to hear. In that case, let’s do this elegantly!
Behold our elegance...even when one of us dared turn his back on the Psychic type!
*tsk*... Those floating balls are so distracting. Still, we’re going to win!
Well, if I must share the pitch with a Dark-type Trainer...at least we’re on the same side.
A pair of newly minted Gym Leaders like us can take on anyone—even the Champion!
Hee hee! C’mon, Bede! Let’s poison them, nice and proper!
You’re a little disquieting, you know... Just try not to get in my way.
All eyes on me, Master! I’ll show you that I’m cute AND strong!
This should be fun! But I don’t plan on letting you steal the spotlight for strength or adorableness!
Team Supercute with Klara and Marnie! Everyone’s gonna be head over heels for us!
I-I’unno about cute or anythin’... But sendin’ ’em head over heels works for me!
Take it easy on those brittle bones, old bloke! The Peony train won’t stop for any bellyachin’!
Watch your mouth, youngster! Try not to get knocked out too soon!
Master Mustard! It’s an honor to battle at your side!
Not to copy you, my boy, but with two former Champions...it’ll be a doubly champion time!
Right then, Leon lad! Let’s put ’em down nice and quick!
I’m looking forward to fighting alongside Steel Peony himself!
All right, Kabu! Let’s show ’em what us edgy older blokes are made of!
Not a bad idea! Say, if we win, why don’t you come back to the League?
Now then, my bed-headed partner! Let us comport ourselves as celebrities would!
What?! This isn’t bed head! That nonsense on your head is worse, anyway!
Like there’s any way us two together could lose! Got yer spikes all tuned up?
You bet! C’mon, Bro—let’s show ’em we’re even fiercer together!
Would you like a cheer from my noble self, miss Dark-type Trainer with your boldly cut hair?
L-lay off! I don’t need your cheerin’! Let’s just focus on the battle!
Your water’s got my Pokémon all energized and happy, Nessa!
I’ll extinguish any flame that so much as casts a spark at your greenery!
Water and rock can douse flame, but my Pokémon can absorb them both!
I’m counting on you, Milo! Let’s show everyone what this team can do!
My Grass-type Pokémon have got your back, Piers! We’ll make sure you have center stage!
Aw, quit embarrassin’ me, Milo! You’ll have to Dynamax for the pair of us!
Hello there, Allister! No need to get nervous. Let’s battle at our own pace!
Th-thanks, Milo... I...appreciate it...
We’ll burn away any plants that try to wring you dry, Nessa!
Great! And let us wash away any stone or earth that tries to quench your flames!
I look forward to learning from the ever-shifting nature of your Water-type moves!
In serious mode like always, aren’t you? Let’s go have a nice dessert once we’ve won!
Water helps push rocks forward... The opponent doesn’t stand a chance!
I never get tired of seeing those backward somersaults of yours, Gordie...
Dark and Dragon, scales and shade! ♪ Fairy types get us both afraid! ♪
You just keep on singing, Piers! I’ll dish out all the damage we need!
All right, Raihan! Use those weather tricks and make it rain cheers in this stadium!
Way ahead of you, Leon! Though I’m already looking forward to taking YOU on!
Remember our plan, Raihan! I’m counting on you to get that weather going!
No hard feelings if the plan slips my mind! You know I run wild in battle!
Hello there, Raihan! I look forward to battling alongside such a mighty Gym Leader!
I know I’m in for a rough time with you, Melony! You’re tough on teammates and opponents alike!
Let’s use our rock-solid moves to crush the willpower of any opponent!
That’s an encouraging sentiment. Let’s take the fight to them, Gordie.
Let us put up a fight worthy of showing to M
It goes without saying, Older Brother! Such is our noble duty!
Don’t mind me, child. You got all the correct answers to my quizzes, so do as you please.
I’ll still back you up the best I can to take some weight off your shoulders, Ms. Opal!
Come now, Bede... Time for our Double Pink Typhoon!
I don’t think that’s a move, Ms. Opal... No matter—I’m sure we’ll win!
What better team-up to make our opponents shiver than Ice and Ghost types?
R-right you are! W-we’ll send chills up their spines...
Come on, Hop! Our bond as brothers is way stronger than any Champion!
I know
better than anybody. You just leave h
imer to me!
Remember our Gym Challenge? I’m gonna let loose all the frustration I’ve been holdin’ in since!
Watch yourself,
! Your old rivals are teaming up to take you down!
Now, I haven’t battled at your side for quite a long while. It’s almost a little embarrassing!
Fuhahaha! We’re still too young to be reminiscing about the good old days, Opal!
Do your best, young Piers. Or I’ll...Play Rough.
Yeah, I’ve gotta pass on that. I don’t think I could handle havin’ an 88-year-old Play Rough.
What say we give this stadium a nice cooling off, Nessa, dear?
Gladly! Let’s dazzle the whole place with our glimmering teamwork!
I’m truly honored to get to battle alongside such a legendary Champion.
Come now, don’t be shy! Stand tall! Let us enjoy the clashing of fists together!
I-I-I’ll...do my best!
Don’t be so nervous, boy! I’m looking forward to seeing how you battle!
I trust you to bring us a silvery-white victory, Lady Melony!
Oh, you’ll embarrass me with that “Lady” talk. Anyway, I’ll leave the Fighting types to you!
Aaah! Ohmygosh, Gordie! You’re super popular! I can’t believe we’re on the same team!
Um, do be careful. A lot of my fans can get a little wild sometimes...
Battling gifted opponents gets my heart beating, no matter how many times I do it!
Let’s hurry and get this started! Time to see who can win some Exp. Points off the other!
I’m really up against the wall now...which will make winning all the more satisfying!
Flex your gigantic muscles, Urshifu! Let your mighty frame burst through the sky itself!
Every one of the thousands of times we’ve swung our fists was for the sake of this moment!
Hmm, yes! I feel an unyielding power emanating from that Pokémon and that move!
Now, was that pinpoint aim or plain luck? Either way...it made things interesting!
A little lapse in judgment, eh? How unlike you!
A fine stroke of luck...but I know you won’t be worn out as easily as that!
I’m still working on getting stronger! So don’t go laughing if I don’t do well!
Still not pulling any punches, I see. Not that I care or anything!
All righty, Slowbro! Time to dream bigger— and be bigger!
Your Pokémon will look sooo much cuter once I give it a nice coat of venom!
You’ll have to do more than that to make me lose heart! I’m gettin’ better every day!
Gah! Seriously? It didn’t work? I hate this...but I should’ve expected as much.
Tee hee! That’s me—as cute as I am clever with moves!
I’ll send your head spinning just like this Poké Ball!
My power only grows when my back’s to the wall. You’ve no one to blame for this but yourself!
With a one, two, three...my Pokémon will be gigantic! And with nothing up my sleeves, either!
Witness my ESP! Which, of course, stands for Elegant Spectacular Power!
S-super effective? Your Nature certainly isn’t Calm, is it?
M-my glasses were foggy! That’s it! I couldn’t see anything—that’s why that happened!
No amount of training can hide one’s weaknesses... That goes for you, too!
All right, let’s give it a go! Watch out, I’m going to get serious!
You’re doing just splendidly,
! This is exactly what makes you our rising star!
All right, my dear Venusaur! Bloom so fully your petals cover the whole island!
Sorry if this stings a bit. That’s just how tough love works!
All right, my dear Blastoise, get ready to give a soaking! Show us that big, splendid shell!
Sorry if you get a bit soggy. I’ll lend you a towel when we’re through here!
My dear Nia’s watchin’ from the sidelines! Time to activate coolest-dad-ever mode!
Don’t go lettin’ your guard down yet! I’ve still got a thrashin’ left to give!
That was one heavy blow! Hope you felt a nice, big thump!
Look at you showin’ how it’s done! I expected nothin’ less from you, Chief!
