A special Poké Ball for the Pal Park.
A nice photo album for storing all the photos taken along your adventure.
A music player that allows you to listen to nostalgic songs. It’s operated with the flip of a single switch.
Mahogany Town’s famous candy. It can be used once to heal all the status conditions of a Pokémon.
